<objective>
Wire Phase 84 Integration end-to-end for configurable ghost override. MainWindow correctly initializes controller with modifier configuration from settings, subscribes to Settings window checkbox events for immediate persistence + runtime updates, replaces two broken IsCtrlAltHeld call sites with IsModifierHeld, and extends ResetToDefaults to restore Ctrl+Alt defaults. Human verification proves checkbox state persistence, Reset to Defaults behavior, all-unchecked semantics, and full modifier combination matrix (Ctrl-only, Alt-only, Shift-only, Ctrl+Alt, Ctrl+Shift, Alt+Shift, all three).

**Purpose:** Complete the configurable ghost override milestone by connecting all components built in Phases 81-83 into a working end-to-end flow.

**Output:** MainWindow builds without errors, full test suite passes, human verification checklist confirms all modifier configuration scenarios work correctly.
</objective>

