  <name>Task 1: Wire ApplySettings + GetCurrentSettingsSnapshot + IsModifierHeld call sites</name>
  
  <read_first>
    - FuzzyClock.App/MainWindow.xaml.cs (lines 230-378 for ApplySettings, lines 380-421 for GetCurrentSettingsSnapshot, lines 1060-1085 for Window_MouseEnter, lines 1530-1546 for Window_PreviewMouseRightButtonUp)
